                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "1. I have no interest in breaking the many many EM configs that exist for such a small maintenance burden as is here.  It's easy to say \"It's not upstream, therefore it doesn't matter\", but this is an extension point that's intentionally supposed to be stable.\n2. I'm not sure the prior patch (which migrated arrays out) fully understood what arrays were meant for.  Lets conclude that conversation before we start trying to enforce things like this."
                }
